            id: "judgment",
            text: "A cold shiver crawls down your spine as darkness closes in. Flesh, ambition, and memory fade alike, reduced at last to ash. Every dream you carried loses its meaning before the silence of the afterlife. There is nothing left now but to face your particular judgment.",
